<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>SkillVerse - Empowering India's Skilled Workforce</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      color: #222;
    }
    header {
      background-color: #0d6efd;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    header p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    section {
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #0d6efd;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .services, .employees {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .service-card, .employee-card {
      background-color: #fff;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }
    .service-card:hover, .employee-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
    }
    footer {
      background-color: #0d6efd;
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>SkillVerse</h1>
    <p>Empowering Bharat with Tech-Skilled Workforce</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Mission</h2>
    <p>SkillVerse is India’s first AI-ready labor and skill-tech ecosystem, empowering youth and workers with future-ready skills, verified jobs, and digital tools—starting from Basti, built for the world.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">What We Do</h2>
    <div class="services">
      <div class="service-card">
        <h3>Skilled Labor Supply</h3>
        <p>Verified, trained labor for factories, events, homes, and businesses across India.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <h3>Micro Training</h3>
        <p>Quick training modules on discipline, safety, soft skills, and AI tools for better work performance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <h3>Smart Matching Platform</h3>
        <p>Employers can easily find and manage skilled workers through our smart, AI-powered dashboard.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <h3>Business Solutions</h3>
        <p>Hiring packages, workforce analytics, and subscription services for growing businesses.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Employee Details</h2>
    <div class="employees">
      <div class="employee-card">
        <h3>Name: Rajesh Kumar</h3>
        <p>Contact: +91 9876543210</p>
        <p>ID: SKV1001</p>
        <p>Address: Village Mahadev, Basti, UP</p>
        <p>Visitor Status: Permanent Staff</p>
      </div>
      <div class="employee-card">
        <h3>Name: Anjali Verma</h3>
        <p>Contact: +91 9123456780</p>
        <p>ID: SKV1002</p>
        <p>Address: Near Ghanta Ghar, Basti, UP</p>
        <p>Visitor Status: On-site Trainee</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Add more employee cards here as needed -->
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2025 SkillVerse. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
